# Development Principles (Rule)

Condensed principles for day-to-day changes. Canonical milestone/governance context:

- `.cursor/commands/milestones.md`
- `.cursor/rules/version-control.mdc`

- Single source of truth
- Minimal change
- Plan-first execution (assess feasibility before making changes)
- Evidence-based decisions
- Context convergence
- State-driven architecture
- Controlled complexity (shallow surfaces)
- Explicit over implicit
- No duplicated logic
- Data-driven over branching
- Fail fast
- Idempotent operations
- Observable system
- Clear boundary isolation
- Refactor on trigger
